    ],
    "windVertexColors": false,
    "notes": "Directional: the mouth faces the model's +Z in Unity, so the level's facingYaw points it at the player. Pivot is base / XY-centred as usual, which puts the mouth plane 1.95 m in FRONT of the pivot along +Z -- set the pivot 1.95 m behind the declared mouth position or the stone sits that far out into the gorge. Carries a Col vertex-colour attribute: blue is the vertex-occlusion mask PokeLabPropGroundBlend multiplies ambient by, near zero down the throat. Import vertex colours on this mesh; discarding them puts the light back into the cave."
  },
